# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit real keys.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Nothing here is needed to reproduce the committed runs: those use the analytic
# surrogate policy and make no network calls. These are what the model benchmark
# needs, and the reason it has not been run yet.

# --- hosted backbones -------------------------------------------------------
# Anthropic levels (Claude Opus 5, with and without extended thinking).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI levels (GPT-4o, and a current reasoning model).
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- open-weights backbones -------------------------------------------------
# Llama-3.3-70B and Qwen3-30B are served locally through the same
# OpenAI-compatible interface, so they cost GPU time rather than tokens.
# Point this at your vLLM server; see scripts/serve_vllm.sh.
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1

# --- keyless check ----------------------------------------------------------
# The LLM path can be exercised end to end with no key at all against the mock
# server, which deliberately returns malformed replies:
#
#     python scripts/mock_llm_server.py --port 8079 &
#     OPENAI_API_KEY=not-needed nudgesim --models openai:mock-a \
#       --backend-url http://127.0.0.1:8079/v1 run --out runs/smoke \
#       --arms core --core-seeds 5
